<title>USA: TABLE - Reunion Industries Inc Q2 shr loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Reunion Industries Inc Q2 shr loss.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
