<p>				 3,855     3,855	 3,855    3,855</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 results included income of $1.1 million from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>In 1997 Q2 saw a strike by unionized workforce at ORC's Rostone division. As a result of the strike, sales and operating income were about $2.0 million and $1.0 million, respectively, less than expected for the period.</p>
<p>Reunion acquired Rostone Corp in February 1996 and acquired Data Packaging Ltd and the assets and business of Quality Molded Products Inc in November 1996. On a pro forma basis, sales of the plastic products segment were $18.2 million and $41.4 million, respectively, for the 1996 second quarter and six months to June 30.</p>
<p>(( -- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
